image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef86d61304889c2d637b04bf97f2c74b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef86d61304889c2d637b04bf97f2c74b, https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3dc7cb9c460846c4521eb96546bf96b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2201ccc26e90b6864ea4284362f2480d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b677bc75252b71533bccd5fb1676196f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b677bc75252b71533bccd5fb1676196f, https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8cdbc7959a26e28e08bbabbbd921ed11 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b70d68cb/uploads/origins/31c6c928-302b-4e73-ae69-c36ca12398db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4391366087a402708adbaf578e775321 3x"}, "body": "Hi \u767d\u6a23\uff0cI'm gald to see you start skeb commission! Sorry for that I cannot use Korean to write to you, so I use English instead. I really like your style of painting, and wanna commission you to draw an illustration for my ocs! Whether one or two is all ok\uff01Actually I want you to design their clothes in Mafia paro\uff0cbut either \u7acb\u3061\u7d75 or \u7d61\u307f\u7d75 is welcomed\uff01\n\uff08I choose nsfw section just to make you draw freely\uff0cit's not mandatory\uff09\n\nMy character has different worldviews. I have listed the original medieval timeline and modern vampire worldline. You can opt to draw clothes and settings from this or other connected paros! Here are descriptions:\n\nvampire paro\uff1a\n\u25b7story\nhttps://skeb.jp/@t0sk1o/works/11\n\u25b7interaction mode\nhttps://skeb.jp/@t0sk1o/works/19\n\noriginal worldline\n\u25b7specific story\uff08still updating\uff09\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/mobile/folders/1WSZhqSom99pW1G7WVK6f-gE-9RL5oHvn/1CS5WQl8BWpIzrL-HHY3NI_HElq_eeBBj?sort=13&direction=a\n\n\u25b7simplified settings and stories\nBackground: Medieval Europe\nA(185cm\uff0c\u653b\u3081):adoptive father, short silver hair and sky blue eyes. \nHe was once a gentle lord, paranoid about revenge due to the betrayal from his country. He is cold and proud in personality, with the elegance and detachment of a nobleman. He never thought he could bear the title of a hero, and sacrificed his human goodness for revenge. However, he was moved and redeemed because B always regarded him as his only hero.\n\nB(178cm\uff0c\u53d7\u3051):the adopted son with light silver twisted braids and rosy red eyes.\nHis father was a subordinate of A, and he was entrusted to A before his death. Due to the war and homeless, he had his faith collapsed and has an indifferent personality. After meeting the hero of his youth, however, he was redeemed by A's meticulous care and decided to help A complete the revenge plan.\nThey are two lonely people, coming together for mutual comfort, licking each other's wounds. On the surface, A appears to be the more composed and taciturn one, while B seems to be the gentler of the two. However, in reality, A is the more gentle and rational one, while B is the one who is mad and fiercely loyal, willing to sacrifice everything for A. Their relationship is kind like dom/sub, with A guides B, and B submits to A.\nAlthough A was deeply betrayed and became obsessed with revenge, even willing to use the power of an evil god to destroy the country, B never gave up on him. B repeatedly persisted in pulling A back from the edge of the abyss, helping A to retain his last shred of humanity. Originally, B had no desire to live, but it was A\u2019s care and love for him that made him willing to sacrifice himself to help A complete a grand reform. Despite A\u2019s inclination to destroy the country and B\u2019s tendency to bring about positive change, they both chose the path of kindness, even going so far as to shape themselves into fanatic-like madmen. They deceived the evil god and attracted his gaze with their own suffering and pain, leading him to B's body. Then B suppressed the consciousness of the evil god with strong willpower and utilized the evil god's  power for himself. Using the power of the evil god, they forced everyone to confront their inner selves and the corruption of the nation. They worked together to develop a plan, executed it separately, one in the open and one in the dark, and ultimately succeeded in bringing positive reforms to the country.\nIn the final scene, the two of them use themselves as bait, in order to delay enough time for the revolutionary army to invade the royal city. Together, they set up a \"stage\" on the top of the bell tower of Notre-Dame Cathedral, attracting the attention of all their enemies under the guise of a cult. After the apparent failure of the evil god plan, A and B as per the plan to leap from the bell tower and fake their deaths, then return to the royal city to bring closure to the successful revolution.\nYou can take this piece of music or the images in the URL as inspiration:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1sPm38qAuHehYX0-Y5Ctkr2GomHPbxZNQ/view?usp=drive_link\n\nTheir story is about redemption, revenge, ambition, and the theme of sacrificing oneself for the future of their country.It's also about \u201c\u4eba\u9593\u8b83\u6b4c\u306f\u300c\u52c7\u6c17\u300d\u306e\u8b83\u6b4c\u30c3\u201d when facing the god.\nYou can draw any feelings about this story\uff01The other things are left to you! Hope you feel free to draw your inspiration!\nIf you feel the amount is not suitable, you can resend it or feel free to reject it!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WSZhqSom99pW1G7WVK6f-gE-9RL5oHvn", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taiyakikuuu2/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3534528, "client_id": 416439, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=394ad9e54e34eed96a7b99255ace1bdd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=394ad9e54e34eed96a7b99255ace1bdd, https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d4227d9467f82d46d2ba1233ccf2827 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9579724e0699e804192f395cd674c3bc 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4a1c80e3eca6368c324a63f406d9302b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1db781a4/uploads/origins/8a4a2229-0f20-4145-9af2-f60e6268dd5